Author: Thierry Dumont [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Thierry Dumont <tdumont@parisnanterre.fr>
Description: Fits composite entropy clusterings and explores fixed or adaptive grids
    of density ceilings and entropy weights. Numeric Gaussian analyses can use
    hard classification EM or constrained soft EM candidate banks followed by
    hard refitting, with or without a Gaussian order penalty. Independent
    original and bootstrap executions provide exhaustive agreement diagnostics,
    a relative stability index and saturation-aware filtering. Historical
    unpenalized categorical and mixed-data CEM remains available. Results can be
    inspected through tables, static plots and an optional Shiny explorer.
    A common interface also provides an experimental candidate-band engine
    with bootstrap anchors, compact storage and separate subdivision screening.
